# 📘 Project Overview

This is a **microSaaS** built with:

- **Next.js 14 (App Router)**
- **Tailwind CSS v4 (PostCSS plugin)**
- **Supabase (Auth, Database, Storage, Realtime)**
- **Hosted on Vercel**
- **Minimal client-side interactivity** — Server Components are preferred

---

## 📦 Tech Stack & Versions

- **Next.js 14** with App Router and `app/` directory
- **Tailwind CSS v4** using the official PostCSS plugin
- **Supabase SDK v2+**, supporting edge and server environments
- **Deployment** via Vercel (edge-ready)

---

## ⚙️ Next.js Rules

- ✅ Use **Server Components** by default
- ✅ Use **Client Components** only for interactivity (e.g., forms, modals)
- ✅ All routes must live under `app/` directory
- ✅ API routes must go in `app/api/[endpoint]/route.ts`
- ❌ Do NOT use `getServerSideProps`, `getStaticProps`, or `pages/` — use fetch and caching strategies from the App Router
- ✅ Place `"use client"` **only** at the top of files that need it

---

## 🎨 TailwindCSS Rules

- ✅ Tailwind CSS v4 must be used with PostCSS as documented: [Tailwind + PostCSS](https://tailwindcss.com/docs/installation/using-postcss)
- ✅ Responsive design is **required** (mobile-first approach)
- ✅ Use Tailwind's built-in variants for hover/focus/dark
- ❌ Do NOT use inline styles — use Tailwind utility classes
- ✅ Order classes: **Layout → Spacing → Typography → Color → State**

---

## 🔐 Supabase Rules

- ✅ Use the **official Supabase JS SDK (`@supabase/supabase-js`)**
- ✅ Wrap all Supabase logic in `lib/` or `hooks/` — **do NOT call `supabase.from()` directly in components**
- ✅ Auth logic must be centralized (e.g., `useAuth()` or `authService`)
- ✅ Store keys and URLs in `.env.local`, never hardcoded
- ✅ Database access should be server-only when possible
- ✅ Close realtime subscriptions on unmount to prevent memory leaks

---

## 🧱 Architecture & Structure

```txt
/src
  /app
    layout.tsx      ← Global layout
    page.tsx        ← Home route
    /api/           ← API Routes
    /feature/       ← Pages and subroutes
  /components       ← Shared UI components
  /hooks            ← Custom React hooks
  /lib/supabase     ← Supabase clients and services

## 📝 Naming Conventions

| Item       | Format      | Example                  |
|------------|-------------|--------------------------|
| Components | PascalCase  | `UserCard.tsx`           |
| Variables  | camelCase   | `eventTitle`, `guestList`|
| Files      | kebab-case  | `guest-table.tsx`        |
| CSS/Assets | kebab-case  | `/public/icons/`         |

